  "idea": "How to turn any website into a standalone desktop app on your computer",
  "text": "Launch your favorite online tools in clean, distraction-free windows without buying expensive desktop software. Working inside browser tabs tempts you with social media bookmarks, search bars, and distracting extensions. Cluttered browser shells steal screen space and make side-by-side window multitasking clunky and annoying. Click your browser menu, choose Save and Share, and create an isolated window shortcut instantly. You gain a sleek native desktop experience in seconds.",
